# Defaults for stow, read from the current directory — so `cd` here first.
# See docs/adr/0002-deploy-with-gnu-stow.md for why.

# Stow defaults its target to the PARENT of this repo. It should be $HOME.
--target=~

# Never fold a directory into a single symlink. Without this, stowing into a
# home directory that lacks ~/.config symlinks all of ~/.config into this repo.
--no-folding
